://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OzDget3pCV9Lq4zcESrAFZwrL-zpmVag/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OzDget3pCV9Lq4zcESrAFZwrL-zpmVag/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OzDget3pCV9Lq4zcESrAFZwrL-zpmVag/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 12-28-2017, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T13:07:16-08:00","id":1171316,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1586_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1586\" data-vbnamecard=\"1586\">Dietaku</a> is this going to be PbP or are we going to do it Real Time on an IRC thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T13:28:57-08:00","id":1171332,"title":"","content":"PbP Aranfan and I am done with my character and bio.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T18:46:20-08:00","id":1171400,"title":"","content":"This game is play by post. <br /> <br /> In addition, since everyone is done, or about to be, I set up the IC thread:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne\"> IC [Exalted 3e] The Pirates of the Gilded Throne - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1171397-ic-exalted-3e-the-pirates-of-the-gilded-throne </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The sun shines high in the sky as you all walk along the cobblestone streets of Flotsam. The mid-morning breeze wafts the air with the scent of the salty oceans all around you, lifting the awnings of the market bazaar, and also shaking the flags strewn across the city, denoting the various nationalities of the owners of the inns and shops across the main thoroughfare. However, this isn't the only spectacle before you; a small crowd has gathered in the square, around a woman tied to a stake. A well-dressed man in a powdered wig, wearing several large hats, is reading off a list of presumable grievances </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> So, post whenever you get a chance.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T18:52:08-08:00","id":1171401,"title":"","content":"What are the grievances?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:04:35-08:00","id":1171409,"title":"","content":"Sextes Jylis, a guy can't go to sea for a week without all sorts of crazy shit happening. Welp, time to sift through all the stuff I missed...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:16:10-08:00","id":1171414,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/\" target=\"_blank\">http://orokos.com/roll/</a> this is a dice roller we can use<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:29:05-08:00","id":1171419,"title":"","content":"Any chance we could open up a roll20 game for dicerolling instead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T19:59:51-08:00","id":1171423,"title":"","content":"I've no experience with roll20, but I'll look t some options. In the meantime, I'll trust you all with your rolls. As per the grievances, I'll answer that in the IC thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-28T20:26:16-08:00","id":1171426,"title":"","content":"Well gents, I'm for stopping the execution. If that's how we're going to proceed how flashy and overt do we want to be?